      diagramCaption: "The line y = x + 1 solves {{x^2 - 3x - 4 = 0}} (x = −1 and x = 4). The line y = 2 solves {{x^2 - 2x - 5 = 0}} (x ≈ −1.4 and x ≈ 3.4).",
